TASK-287 runtime harness: site search in the command palette and Settings >
Search. Temporary code, never committed to Detour/. Apply, build, run, revert:

    git apply docs/harness/task287-harness.patch
    xcodegen generate
    xcodebuild -scheme Detour -configuration Debug build -derivedDataPath .derived
    OUT=<dir>; DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR="$OUT" DETOUR_DATA_DIR=DetourVerify287 \
        .derived/Build/Products/Debug/Detour.app/Contents/MacOS/Detour &
    # "SHOOT <windowNumber> <tag>" lines: `screencapture -x -o -l <windowNumber> <tag>.png`;
    # wait for "done" (about 25 s), kill that pid, then:
    git apply -R docs/harness/task287-harness.patch && xcodegen generate

Seeds a typed visit to youtube.com, brings the window forward, then in a
Cmd+T palette types "you" (completes to youtube.com, the Search YouTube row
appears), Tab (YouTube mode), "cats", Return (logs the selected tab's URL);
then "w " (keyword + Space: Wikipedia mode) and Backspace (back to "w");
then opens Settings > Search and its add sheet for captures.

Results (2026-11-07): every step as above; Return loaded
https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=cats; the starter set was seeded
in the new data directory. The first window capture can fail with "could not
create image from window" while the window is still coming forward.

